Package: PhenotypeReport
Type: Package
Title: Phenotype Report Generation from Strategus Results
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
  person("William", "O'Brien", email = "willjobrien@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Provides functions and Quarto templates to facilitate writing
    epidemiological phenotype reports from Strategus results folders. Supports
    summarizing database metadata, cohort counts, characteristics, and other
    modules produced by the OHDSI Strategus pipeline.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/ohdsi/PhenotypeReport
